      "review": {
        "status": "pass",
        "rationale": "Inspected both dialogue lines and supplied-chest approach at desktop and 390px phone scale. Wren, player, Fernling and chest remain visible; actual text fragments clear Next/Done; the live objective is readable in the sidebar (scrollable on phone). The final fixture keeps the player beside the chest rather than inside its image. Generic engine presentation is not a claim of bespoke adventure polish. Compatible #258 schema addition was rerun and the regenerated desktop/phone captures were inspected; owner status is unchanged. Repeated controls and captures after the opt-in orchard interaction priority change; teaching fixture behavior is preserved."
      }
    },
    "narrativePurpose": {
      "status": "pass",
      "findings": [],
      "review": {
        "status": "pass",
        "rationale": "Wren explicitly offers supplies for the road and the player acknowledges the host. A useful once-only reward fulfills that practical purpose; no unrelated chest or unresolved mystery is used as a substitute payoff. This is a small teaching beat, not an approval of the archived Fernling mystery or a professional vertical slice."
      }
    }
